flowchart TD
    START[Goal и bounded context] --> PLAN[Structured planner decision]
    PLAN --> VALID{Schema и registry валидни?}
    VALID -->|Не| ERROR[Запиши грешка / bounded retry]
    ERROR --> PLAN
    VALID -->|execute| POLICY[Policy и approval]
    POLICY --> EXEC[Executor]
    EXEC --> OBS[Реална observation]
    OBS --> VERIFY[Независен verifier]
    VERIFY --> SAVE[Persist step и evidence]
    SAVE --> PLAN
    VALID -->|finish| CHECK{Goal conditions проверени?}
    CHECK -->|Да| DONE[done]
    CHECK -->|Не, има budget| PLAN
    CHECK -->|Нема budget| PARTIAL[partial / failed]
    VALID -->|fail| PARTIAL
